                <pb facs="0935" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg823"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 891.001.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the United States to the Shah of
                        Persia.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-09-23"><hi rendition="#italic">September 23,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received with profound regret the announcement of the death, on September
                    22, of His Imperial Highness the Regent.</p>
                <p>I convey to you my sincere condolence.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
